        "TileImage": "$($repository c3ef8f1c-9857-4196-acd3-fd9ea1b81d52).Image",
        "Description": "Today, 47, you will be in the midst of some family drama. Most of the al-Ghazali family sees Salman as incontrollable and wreckless, yet he is still the heir to the family name. Salman and his bodyguard, Michel Charest, have been marked as your targets for this contract. The family has requested zero collateral damage and for there to be as little evidence of the murder as possible. As such, you are not to be recorded at any point or be seen commiting any crimes. Good hunting, 47.",
